    <briefdescription>
<para>Global variable summary information to aid decisions and implementation of importing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Global variable summary has two extra flag, telling if it is readonly or writeonly. Both readonly and writeonly variables can be optimized in the backed: readonly variables can be const-folded, while writeonly vars can be completely eliminated together with corresponding stores. We let both things happen by means of internalizing such variables after ThinLTO import. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
